Cell["\<\
As one can see above, the second index is shared by three tensors, meaning it \
is not a pairwise/binary tensor\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.976068374858541*^9, 
  3.9760684050974407`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b31243cc-7893-4ff4-953f-\
ace928b17aed"],

